{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ remaining" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ until full" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 后充满"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "A backup's custom items: their count, then the script widgets note",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@, %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@，%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld item"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld items"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld 项"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items made by a newer version of Rolltop are kept but not shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld item made by a newer version of Rolltop is kept but not shown."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld items made by a newer version of Rolltop are kept but not shown."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld 个由较新版本 Rolltop 创建的项已保留，但不会显示。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld pt" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld pt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld script widgets arrive turned off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld script widget arrives turned off"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld script widgets arrive turned off"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld 个脚本小组件将以关闭状态导入"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gap between items, blank or with a short text, an emoji or a symbol. Right-click a spacer in the menu bar to edit or remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项之间的间隔，可以留空，也可以放一段简短文字、表情符号或符号。在菜单栏中右键点按间隔符即可编辑或移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A right-click always shows the details and “Edit Widget…”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "右键点按始终会显示详细信息和“编辑小组件…”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A script widget runs only after you turn it on in this list on this Mac. Imported or restored script widgets start turned off, and changing the command turns it off again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "脚本小组件只有在这台 Mac 上于此列表中开启后才会运行。导入或恢复的脚本小组件初始为关闭状态，更改命令也会使其重新关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short text before the value, such as a city for a second clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示在数值前的简短文字，例如第二个时钟所在的城市。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny graph of the last readings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近读数的小型图表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
