          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows what plays in Music or Spotify once you allow that app in Settings › Permissions. A click plays or pauses; the widget is hidden while nothing plays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“设置 › 权限”中允许“音乐”或 Spotify 后，显示其正在播放的内容。点按可播放或暂停；没有播放内容时小组件会隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small live read-outs. A click can open an app, a file or a link, run a Rolltop command or show details. Sampling pauses while the displays sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小巧的实时读数。点按时可以打开 App、文件或链接，运行 Rolltop 命令，或显示详细信息。显示器睡眠时会暂停采样。"
          }
        }
